      "cooked": "<p>Can a hero target themselves with a card or power if it is not an ability like absolute zero’s where it says “deals himself” ?</p>\n<p>This question came up last night where a friend playing absolute zero wanted to target himself with a card worded “1 target” and not “deals himself.”</p>\n<p>If absolute zero can chose to target himself then I would assume anyone could target themselves…</p>",
