      "created_at": "2012-10-14T18:36:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Absolutely you can.</p><p>As a caveat, some cards (especially in Absolute Zero's deck) specify a non-hero target.&nbsp;&nbsp;For those cards&nbsp;he cannot target himself.&nbsp; However something that just says one target means any card with HP.</p>",
